This software implements draft-gco-oauth-delegate-sd-jwt-00 and RFC 9901.
Its behaviour is aligned for interoperability with the SD-JWT delegation
chain implementation in the Google Agent Payments Protocol (AP2) Python
SDK, which is also licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. No AP2
source code is included in this work.
